  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/IMG_9312.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Lluna Estilistes, en la avenida de Catalu&ntilde;a, 36 de Onda, sigue con su constante innovaci&oacute;n en peluquer&iacute;a y estilismo. Ahora presentan el esmaltado en seco de u&ntilde;as, en colaboraci&oacute;n con 5 Lobitos, que ha aportado la moda juvenil, y JoieriaD&#39;Or, con los relojes y pulseras juveniles OPS Objects!</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9229.jpg\" alt=\"img_9229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9231.jpg\" alt=\"img_9231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9233.jpg\" alt=\"img_9233\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9234.jpg\" alt=\"img_9234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9238.jpg\" alt=\"img_9238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9243.jpg\" alt=\"img_9243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9244.jpg\" alt=\"img_9244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/esmaltpermanentllunaestilistes5lobitosdor/img_9245.jpg\" alt=\"img_9245\